      "twenty five",
      "twentyfive"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tip",
     "tag": "Spanish speaker alert",
     "title": "Don't drop the -s",
     "paras": [
      "In Spanish the verb changes by itself: <i>muestra, mide</i>. In English, the -s is small and easy to forget, but people hear it.",
      "Also: <b>the helm</b> is the steering; <b>the heading</b> is where the bow points now; <b>the course</b> is the planned way."
     ],
     "avoid": "The autopilot steer the ship. · It give the heading."
    },
    {
     "type": "choice",
     "q": "The autopilot ___ the ship.",
     "opts": [
