      "steer",
      "is steer"
     ],
     "a": 0
    },
    {
     "type": "tip",
     "tag": "Pronunciation",
     "title": "Three sounds for -s",
     "paras": [
      "After most sounds, the -s is a soft <b>/z/</b>: <i>shows, gives, steers</i>.",
      "After <i>s, sh, ch, j</i> sounds it's a new syllable <b>/ɪz/</b>: <i>measures, watches</i>.",
      "<b>radar</b> = /ˈreɪdɑː/, <i>RAY-dar</i>. <b>ECDIS</b> = <i>EK-dis</i>."
     ],
